    platformEyebrow: 'Native Windows · macOS · Linux', platformTitle: 'A terminal multiplexer that runs natively on Windows.',
    platformLead: 'AnyTTY ships native CLI, TUI, and daemon builds for Windows x64 and ARM64. No WSL is required for the core workflow, and the same workspace model also runs on macOS and Linux.',
